- Map data: packages/core/assets/map_osm.geojson is derived from OpenStreetMap,
  (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the Open Database License
  (ODbL) 1.0 — https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright. Anything that shows it
  has to credit OpenStreetMap.

- Faction emblems: packages/core/assets/logos/ are the factions' and the event
  organiser's (Airsoft Helden) artwork, used here with the events they belong
  to. They are not licensed for other uses by this file.

- Tactical maps: reference/tactical-maps/ are the organiser's printed maps,
  kept as source material only.
